<title>USA: Safeskin Corp Q1 net increases.</title>
<headline>Safeskin Corp Q1 net increases.</headline>
<dateline>SAN DIEGO 1997-04-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>For the Quarters Ended</p>
<p>						3/31/97	    3/31/96</p>
<p>OPERATIONS</p>
<p> Net Sales				  $41,168	     33,055</p>
<p> Net Income				   8,490		5,450</p>
<p>Per share Amounts:</p>
<p>   Primary				     0.30		 0.21</p>
<p>   Fully Diluted			     0.30		 0.20</p>
<p>Weighted Average Common</p>
<p>Shares outstanding</p>
<p> Primary				 28,708,791	 26,345,186</p>
<p> Fully Diluted			 28,708,791	 27,466,654</p>
<p>	     (Dollars in Thousands, Except Per Share Amounts)</p>
<p>NOTE:  Safeskin Corp said net income per share has been adjusted to reflect its two for one stock split on January 2, 1997.</p>
</text>
